        "description": "Presence of ophthalmoplegia or nystagmus",
        "category": "minor",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Progressive cerebellar ataxia plus positive genetic testing for ATXN3 CAG expansion",
    "notes": "Genetic confirmation is essential for definitive diagnosis; clinical features guide testing."
